#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Manage movie recordings</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For changing an already scheduled movie recording open the movie manager and "
"choose the movie you want to manage. &kalva; fills the parameters of the "
"scheduled movie into the record movie tab. Make your changes and hit the "
"record button. The movie recording will be scheduled with the new values."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "The movie manager shows the new scheduled movie."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For deleting an already scheduled movie recordings open the movie manager "
"and choose the movie you want to delete. &kalva; fills the parameters of the "
"scheduled movie into the record movie tab. Hit the delete button. The at job "
"for the movie recording will be deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "The movie manager will be reread to reflect the changes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number behind the starttime is the id of the atjob. If you want to learn "
"more about how &kalva; schedules the movies you might read the manpage of "
"the console tools atd, at, atq and atrm."
msgstr ""

