"manager and choose the serial you want to delete. &kalva; fills the "
"parameters of the scheduled serial into the record serial tab. Hit the "
"delete button. The crontab entry for the serial recordings will be deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "The serial manager will be reread to reflect the changes."
